\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces The practice loop. Each condition is a fresh LLM chat. The LLM returns a file that builds every weight; a static check and a sandbox enforce the rules before the weights are loaded. Practice passes return feedback on practice images only; the LLM decides when to stop, and its FINAL file is scored once on the test collection. Conditions differ only in what the prompt and the feedback contain (Table~\ref {tab:conds}).}}{2}{figure.1.1}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:loop}{{1}{2}{The practice loop. Each condition is a fresh LLM chat. The LLM returns a file that builds every weight; a static check and a sandbox enforce the rules before the weights are loaded. Practice passes return feedback on practice images only; the LLM decides when to stop, and its FINAL file is scored once on the test collection. Conditions differ only in what the prompt and the feedback contain (Table~\ref {tab:conds})}{figure.1.1}{}}
